        "richtext_KVwyx9": {
          "type": "richtext",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>In a season marked by relational tension, business burnout, and caring for my dad through stage 4 cancer, I found myself longing for peace, clarity, and space to breathe.<br/><br/>Over months of wrestling, praying, and waiting for clarity, the idea quietly surfaced. I began to wonder:<br/><br/>What if something as simple as lip balm could help anchor you in truth?</p><p>Something you reach for daily—a gentle nudge to pause, breathe, and remember what’s true.</p>"
          }
        }
